MODULE: CursorTrimEntitledPastCursor
TARGET: CursorTrimEntitled
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the cursor arm trims to the log head instead of the reported cursor and read position
PERTURBS: CursorTrim

--- FIND
    /\ \E t \in (trim[p] + 1)..CursorBound(p) :
--- REPLACE
    /\ \E t \in (trim[p] + 1)..Len(logs[p]) :
--- END
